  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "xu-zhimo-poems-s0007-p00007",
      "source_en": "I am a fragment of cloud in the sky, sometimes I cast a shadow on the heart of your waves. You need not be astonished, and need not be glad either. In a moment, the trace vanishes. You and I met upon the sea in the dark night, you have your course, and I have mine. Whether you remember it is fine, better still, you may forget it, this bright moment of mutual radiance at our meeting.",
